# Everything here that is regenerable or large stays out of a public repo.
# A day's source of truth is script.json (+ index.html, timings.json); the
# images are public-domain files re-fetched from Wikimedia Commons (their
# origin is kept in assets/credits.json), the audio is re-synthesised
# locally, and renders are outputs.
